Package: qlcplus-data
Section: misc
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Q Light Controller Plus - architecture independent data
 Software lighting desk for controlling professional lighting fixtures.
 .
 This package contains the fixture definitions, gobos, input profiles, MIDI
 templates and RGB scripts shared by QLC+ 4 and QLC+ 5.

